11
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:15,850
Let's take it in order. Watch the speech,
and then I'll add a few words of my own.

12
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:21,727
Robert Iskanderovich Nigmatulin, member of
the Russian Academy of Sciences and

13
00:01:21,727 --> 00:01:27,161
scientific director of the Shirshov
Institute of Oceanology, is one of our

14
00:01:27,161 --> 00:01:28,850
leading mathematicians.

15
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,850
