16
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:41,850
Thank you, Konstantin Anatolyevich. You
can see the title: “Troubles.”

17
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:47,849
I sincerely believe we are in trouble.
This is about the first steps and the

18
00:01:47,849 --> 00:01:49,850
