19
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:56,850
I absolutely agree with you, Konstantin
Anatolyevich and Sergey Yuryevich.

20
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:05,130
What troubles? Look at the indicators. Our
per capita incomes are the lowest in

21
00:02:05,130 --> 00:02:05,850
Europe.

22
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:13,850
Under Soviet rule we really did live more
poorly, but we were building the country.

23
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:17,819
We were building our space program and
nuclear power industry. We were leaders,

24
00:02:17,819 --> 00:02:19,850
and of course we made sacrifices for that.

25
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,850
And now? We have lost everything and are
still the poorest.

26
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:32,238
Even China's poorest regions have higher
incomes than our poorest regions. How can

27
00:02:32,238 --> 00:02:34,850
