destroyed.

77
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:40,850
Four million workers in 1999; now 440,000.
Nearly ten times fewer.

78
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:44,544
Light industry is down threefold, while we
have 1.5 million couriers and security

79
00:06:44,544 --> 00:06:44,850
guards.

80
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:51,173
We have 54 scientists per 10,000 people,
compared with 174 in advanced countries.

81
00:06:51,173 --> 00:06:52,850
That's our efficiency.

82
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:59,611
Would anyone invest in a country in this
condition, under this management? Don't do

83
00:06:59,611 --> 00:06:59,850
it.

84
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:05,587
I say you cannot run an economy this way.
We must convey this to the president,

85
00:07:05,587 --> 00:07:07,850
because everything rests on him.

86
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:14,340
God forbid his authority should be shaken
or something else should happen. We cannot

87
00:07:14,340 --> 00:07:15,850
