88
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:22,265
The established order is dangerous. As
Bastrykin says, we cannot go on this way.

89
00:07:22,265 --> 00:07:24,850
Officials are arrested every day.

90
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:29,850
And now there are budget cuts. Why?
Because the economy is falling.

91
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:35,743
In my view the crisis will be prolonged.
It won't resolve itself because everything

92
00:07:35,743 --> 00:07:36,850
