93
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:41,850
We urgently need repairs rather than
excessively high interest rates.

94
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:50,807
A high rate is like refusing treatment:
just hold on and endure the pain and

95
00:07:50,807 --> 00:07:51,850
troubles.

96
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:58,253
The present people running the economy,
education and social services are

97
00:07:58,253 --> 00:08:01,850
completely unfit. They need to be removed.

98
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:09,850
We need to convince the president of this.

99
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:15,992
Of course investment must grow, but
efficiency must improve too. Improving

100
00:08:15,992 --> 00:08:20,850
