101
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,850
That requires different people and
different rules.

102
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:28,061
And domestic raw and semi-processed
materials: you produce them and are taxed

103
00:08:28,061 --> 00:08:28,850
