106
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:45,768
That weighs on the economy. Electricity is
80% more expensive, weighing on all

107
00:08:45,768 --> 00:08:47,850
industry and processing.

108
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:53,757
Taxes should not be levied on these raw
materials for domestic use. On exports,

109
00:08:53,757 --> 00:08:54,850
