110
00:08:55,000 --> 00:09:00,850
Their low cost is our advantage, and they
should remain cheap.

111
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:06,709
Stop tormenting small businesses. People
find work and customers for themselves.

112
00:09:06,709 --> 00:09:08,850
Don't torment them with taxes.

113
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:11,843
This is also a government issue. They now
say a third of small and medium-sized

114
00:09:11,843 --> 00:09:12,850
