115
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:20,062
But they should account for more than
50–60%, as in countries around the world.

116
00:09:20,062 --> 00:09:21,850
Give people freedom.

117
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:27,841
They will adapt and get things done. We
have smart people, but bureaucracy weighs

118
00:09:27,841 --> 00:09:28,850
