119
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:34,850
And the tax system: whom should we tax?
Not production, but high incomes.

120
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:46,850
Look: the share of personal income tax in
other countries is 30%; here it is 15%.

121
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:52,659
Don't tax oil and production for the
domestic market in a way that drives up

122
00:09:52,659 --> 00:09:53,850
