125
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:04,850
We are heading toward trouble, toward a
double-digit economic decline.

126
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:11,220
I can endure a 10% cut in consumption; we
can endure it, but the threat is even

127
00:10:11,220 --> 00:10:11,850
greater.

128
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:17,850
We must restore all the key strategic
institutions. All decisions must...

129
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:28,418
In closing: we are late. Colleagues, we
are late, and the world won't wait. Time

130
00:10:28,418 --> 00:10:29,850
